  "query_preview": "period of dry weather is expected for the remainder of\nthe week and likely through the upcoming weekend. A very blocky\nupper level pattern is progged to set up across central and\neastern North America, so very little day to day change in our\nweather is expected. By later in the weekend into early next\nweek, some breakdown in the blocking pattern is possible with\nupper ridging developing eastward. Assuming this plays out as \nprogged (lower than avg confidence given the tendency for \nguidance to break down blocking patterns too quickly), then a \nwarning trend would take place late in the weekend into early \nnext week. \n\n- Izzi",
